  "10.5.60.70(1)": {
   "explanation": "In residential zones, sheds, garages and other ancillary structures count toward lot coverage and together may cover no more than 10% of the lot. That 10% cap does not apply to a lot with a houseplex or a secondary suite as long as everything on the lot covers no more than 45%.",
